OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBecoming dry
OL,6,Fand clear inland and turning chilly as
OL,7,Fwinds ease. Rural frost and the odd
OL,8,Ffog patch in the north and west, but
OL,9,Fstaying somewhat breezier and milder
OL,10,Falong some coasts with showers
OL,11,Fcontinuing in North Sea coastal
OL,12,Fregions.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FA fine autumnal day for most
OL,15,Fwith plenty of sunshine. Showers
OL,16,Fremain possible in eastern counties of
OL,17,FEngland and the far north of Scotland.
OL,18,FA chilly northerly breeze for some.
